config BR2_PACKAGE_GPS_ASSIST
	bool "GPS assistance data service"
	help
	  Downloads and injects XTRA predicted orbit data into the
	  Qualcomm modem to reduce GPS time-to-first-fix (TTFF).

	  Runs at boot and optionally refreshes XTRA data periodically
	  via a cron job (requires a cron daemon to be enabled).
